## How to use this list

Services listed here are **approved for use** in the `{{SHORT_CODE}}` Azure tenant.
Using a service not on this list requires a service request (see `service-request-issue.md`).

The **Tier** column indicates the level of review applied:

| Tier | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| 1 — Core | Pre-approved; no service request needed |
| 2 — Approved | Listed after InfoSec review; standard onboarding applies |
| 3 — Conditional | Approved with constraints; read the notes column |

