## Compute

| Service | Tier | Notes |
|---------|------|-------|
| Azure Virtual Machines | 1 | Approved VM extensions list: `approved-patterns.md` |
| Azure Kubernetes Service | 2 | Requires private cluster + Azure CNI |
| Azure App Service | 2 | HTTPS-only enforced by policy |
| Azure Functions | 2 | Consumption or Elastic Premium only |
| Azure Container Instances | 3 | No persistent volumes; dev/test only |

